        "@value": "{\"action\":\"issue a limited-validity passport in the requested name\",\"actor\":\"\",\"alternative_quotes\":[],\"choice_text\":\"\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"kind\":\"permission\",\"logic_text\":\"insufficient time to request that the applicant submit acceptable ID prior to urgent or emergency travel\",\"modality\":\"may\",\"object\":\"a limited-validity passport\",\"scope_text\":\"If the applicant has had a material name change more than one year prior to applying on form DS-11 but has not updated her/his ID to reflect the material name change, and there is insufficient time to request acceptable ID submission prior to urgent or emergency travel.\",\"summary\":\"A limited-validity passport may be issued in the requested name if there is insufficient time before urgent or emergency travel to request that an applicant who had a name change over a year ago submit updated ID.\"}",
